# Validation & Limitations

## Validation Strategy

The project uses:

•⁠  ⁠Chronological train/test splits
•⁠  ⁠TimeSeriesSplit
•⁠  ⁠Zero look-ahead feature engineering
•⁠  ⁠Out-of-Sample R²
•⁠  ⁠MSE for equity forecasting
•⁠  ⁠Forecast visualization
•⁠  ⁠Comparative model analysis

## Small Sample Size

The macroeconomic dataset contains relatively few observations.

This limits:

•⁠  ⁠Statistical power
•⁠  ⁠Model complexity
•⁠  ⁠Hyperparameter search
•⁠  ⁠Confidence in short test windows

## GDP Interpolation

Annual GDP data is interpolated to quarterly frequency.

This increases the effective sample size but does not create genuinely observed quarterly GDP observations.

Therefore, results involving interpolated GDP should be interpreted carefully.

